<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "\"Akta ibu\" dalam Akta ini, adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas sahaja subseksyen (3), subseksyen baru (4) dan (5) berikut: \"(4) No licence shall be assigned, transferred, or sublet, to any person, unless the written consent of the Minister has been given. (5) A licence granted under this Part shall not preclude the application of Part V including the requirement for a separate licence under section 37 of that Part, whenever the telecommunications network involves a radiocommunication station.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
