<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_3__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas sahaja takrif \"television broadcast receiver\" takrif berikut: ' \"television receive only station\" means a radiocommunication station consisting of an antennae, a radiocommunication receiver and television broadcast receiver or video monitor or other apparatus used or capable of being used for the purpose of visual and aural reception directly from a space station of any broadcast matter;'."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
