<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "memasukkan selepas sahaja subseksyen (2), subseksyen baru (2A) berikut: \"(2A) The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, exempt absolutely or subject to such conditions as may be prescribed, the requirement of a licence under this section in respect of any low power radiocommunication apparatus, or any class thereof.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
