<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen bam sahaja seksyen 37, seksyen baru 37A berikut: \"Subscribers 3?A. (1) In granting a licence under section to specific 37, the Minister may, in certain specific services, license an operator of radiocommunication network to include any apparatus used by a subscriber to that radiocommunication network, and may impose payment of such fees as may be necessary reflecting the number of subscribers. (2) Where a licence is granted to an operator of a radiocommunication network which includes any apparatus used by a subscriber to that radiocommunication network, any person subscribing to the specific services of that radiocommunication network shall be deemed to have been duly licensed and shall not be required to be licensed separately under this Act or any regulation made thereunder. (3) For the purpose of this section— \"radiocommunication network\" means any system or series of systems for carrying out communications by means of radio or Hertzian waves; and \"specific services\" means those specific services prescribed by the Minister by order published in the Gazette.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
