<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@/~cl_6__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memasukkan selepas sahaja perkataan-perkataan \"television broadcast receiver\" yang terdapat di akhir proviso kepadanya perkataan-perkataan \"except where the television broadcast receiver forms part of a television receive only station\";"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/31/msa@> .
